## Prototype Instructions

> **Mode**: Prototype
> **Purpose**: After generating all flows, connect screens into interactive prototypes.

### Prototype P.1: {{Flow Name}} Interactive Flow

```
**TASK**: Connect the following screens into an interactive prototype:

**Flow sequence**:
{{Screen A}} → ({{trigger: e.g., "Login button click"}}) → {{Screen B}}
{{Screen B}} → ({{trigger: e.g., "Store card click"}}) → {{Screen C}}
{{Screen C}} → ({{trigger: e.g., "Back button"}}) → {{Screen B}}
{{...}}

**Transitions**: Use {{fade / slide-left / none}} between screens.
**Missing screens**: If the flow requires screens not yet generated, suggest what's needed.
```

